  "name": {
   "zh": "深度贴图与法线 · MoGe",
   "en": "Depth Map and Normals · MoGe"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "MoGe 从单目开放域画面恢复三维几何，包括真实尺度的点图、真实尺度的深度贴图、法线贴图和摄影机视场角。这张卡交付一套多层 EXR（深度贴图、法线贴图各一层）和 USD（摄影机、点云）；点云是每帧一片，不是整段一套场景点云。",
   "en": "MoGe recovers 3D geometry from open-domain monocular images, including metric pointmaps, metric depth maps, normal maps and the camera field of view. This card delivers a multi-layer EXR (one layer each for depth and normals) and a USD (camera, point cloud); the point cloud is one per frame, not one scene point cloud for the whole shot."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "depth_image",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
